{"id":4268,"date":"2021-01-31T16:13:35","date_gmt":"2021-01-31T16:13:35","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/training-and-courses\/"},"modified":"2022-06-20T10:59:04","modified_gmt":"2022-06-20T10:59:04","slug":"training-and-courses","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/training-and-courses\/","title":{"rendered":"Training and courses"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"4268\" class=\"elementor elementor-4268 elementor-3778\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-ee35c93 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"ee35c93\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0a55418\" data-id=\"0a55418\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fb424a3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"fb424a3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Molecular spectroscopy courses<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e8ad703 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e8ad703\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Thanks to the improving epidemiological situation, we look forward to meeting you at the seminar Molecular Spectroscopy 2022, which <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">will take place<\/span> on 3rd &#8211; 5th &#8211; 5. of October 2022. Deadline for registration is the 31th of March. However, do not hesitate to contact us even after the registration deadline: if the capacity is not exhausted, we will be happy to see you at the meeting.<br \/><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>We organize molecular spectroscopy courses only for users of spectrometers from Nicolet CZ. They are always free for new owners of our devices!<\/p>\n<p>We have created a training schedule for you for the year 2022. Some courses are offered in different months than in previous years.&nbsp; We will specify the expected dates of the events depending on the current situation in the given period.<\/p>\n<p>An overview of annual courses can be found <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/02\/60a64d3f.pdf\">here<\/a>. Their dates may differ from those in previous years. Below are only those courses that have not taken place this year.<\/p>\n<p><strong>More detailed information about all courses can be found in their descriptions and applications can be downloaded here:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/12\/cf578043.doc\">Registration for courses 2022<\/a><\/li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/12\/b32be7f5.docx\">Registration for the seminar Molecular Spectroscopy 2022<\/a> (October 3. &#8211; 5., 2022)<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/02\/60a64d3f.pdf\">Annual courses<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Materials from individual courses (lectures, exercises etc.) are available on request. At the end of each course you will get a participant certification. In case of interest or questions, contact us at the e-mail address <a href=\"mailto:fidlerova@nicoletcz.cz\">fidlerova@nicoletcz.cz<\/a>.<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"re